<Base title="Contact — Tom De Smedt" description="Get in touch with Tom De Smedt.">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="kicker">Contact</p>
    <h1>Say hello</h1>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        The fastest way to reach me is email:
        <a href="mailto:tom@tdsgn.be"><strong>tom@tdsgn.be</strong></a>
      </p>
      <p>
        You can also find me on
        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/tdesmedt">LinkedIn</a> or browse my public code on
        <a href="https://github.com/tdesmedt-tdsgn">GitHub</a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you're writing about a potential engagement, a sentence or two about your
        organisation and what you're trying to achieve is plenty — no brief required.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
